  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### Create and Link a Director from Self-Assessment\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 18 Mar, 2024 at  4:18 PM\n\n\t\tClick here to watch how to Create and link a Director from the Self Assessment module\n\nNavigation: Self Assessment module >> + Client >> Select the ‘Client Type’ as ‘Individual'.\n\nThis integration seamlessly enables users to create and link individual clients from the Self Assessment module to existing limited company(s), as directors. Additionally, it allows for linking of directors already added to the Self Assessment module, with existing limited company(s). \n\nWhen creating a new client, select 'Individual' as the 'Client Type'. You can then click on the field 'Assign as Director' on the right and select the limited company(s) you wish to assign this director to.\n\nIf the individual is already created in the Self Assessment module, navigate to the client-specific workspace and edit the 'Assessee Details' box to assign him/her as a director of an existing limited company.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
