; font-weight: 700;\">Navigation</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">: Self Assessment module &gt;&gt; + Client &gt;&gt; Select the ‘Client Type’ as ‘Individual'.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This integration seamlessly enables users to create and link individual clients from the Self Assessment module to existing limited company(s), as directors. Additionally, it allows for linking of directors already added to the Self Assessment module, with existing limited company(s).&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">When creating a new client, select 'Individual' as the 'Client Type'. You can then click on the field 'Assign as Director' on the right and select the limited company(s) you wish to assign this director to.</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><s